.UNINDENT
.SS VOID filter_re(REGEX expression)
.sp
Delete all cookies from internal vmod storage that matches the
regular expression \fBexpression\fP\&.
.sp
Example:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
sub vcl_recv {
    cookie.parse(\(dqcookie1=value1; cookie2=value2; cookie3=value3\(dq);
    cookie.filter_re(\(dq^cookie[12]$\(dq);
    # get_string() will now yield \(dqcookie3=value3\(dq
}
